        "candidate_id": "C_f9ab5490f06e142a_0",
        "edit": "Fix malformed binary literals in the case statement: 3'b100 was 8'b0001_000 (7 bits) and 3'b111 was 8'b100_0000 (7 bits); corrected to 8'b0001_0000 and 8'b1000_0000 respectively so each one-hot output has exactly 8 bits.",
